# promise: #649
# Arc's Library shortcuts are show/hide toggles (the actions their keys run): ⇧⌘L opens the Library and closes it again, ⇧⌘J shows Downloads and
# closes it again, and from another page it goes to Downloads. A download row shows Arc's ••• on hover, which opens the
# menu a right-click gives (GitHub #649).
home
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
cra://open?url=file://${FIXTURES}/Pages/downloads.html
expect-log loaded file:
cra://debug?cdp=Input.dispatchMouseEvent&params={"type":"mousePressed","x":36,"y":56,"button":"left","clickCount":1}
cra://debug?cdp=Input.dispatchMouseEvent&params={"type":"mouseReleased","x":36,"y":56,"button":"left","clickCount":1}
expect-log Download finished
wait 1

# ⇧⌘J: Downloads, then closed.
cra://action/viewDownloads
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryShown=j1
expect-log library shown j1: downloads
cra://debug?libraryMore=row
expect-log library more row: more=1 menu=Open .*Show in Finder
cra://action/viewDownloads
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryShown=j2
expect-log library shown j2: closed

# ⇧⌘L: the page last shown, then closed.
cra://action/openLibrary
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryShown=l1
expect-log library shown l1: downloads
cra://action/openLibrary
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryShown=l2
expect-log library shown l2: closed

# From another page ⇧⌘J goes to Downloads, and closes it from there.
cra://action/viewMedia
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryShown=media
expect-log library shown media: media
cra://action/viewDownloads
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryShown=switched
expect-log library shown switched: downloads
cra://action/viewDownloads
wait 1
cra://debug?libraryShown=j3
expect-log library shown j3: closed
